   "kind": "note",
   "props": {
    "text": "LAB 2 — ACOUSTIC RESPONSE TRIALS\nSUBJECT: D. (14 months)\n\nTrials 1–6: carrier ON → subject turns toward the array, stills, smiles. Carrier OFF → no response.\n\nTrial 7: carrier ON, array transmitting NOTHING. The carrier modulates on its own. It is copying the subject's babble. Back to him.\n\nTrial 8: subject laughs. The carrier laughs.\n\n(E.V.:) It doesn't want us. It wants him. It has been listening for him.\n(S.L.:) Then for God's sake get him out of here.\n(M.S.:) I'll take him up tonight. — M.",
