    "text": "OCTOBER 1998\n\n14  Danny — 14 months. Hearing assessment 6.\n15  Directorate call. They want Phase III by the 20th. They want the future. They don't care what comes with it.\n16  Run 19 prep. Marcus refuses to sign. Signed it myself.\n17  RUN 19 — 02:40\n     (underlined twice:) Mira takes D. up BEFORE we start. Non-negotiable.\n18  —",
