     "vo": "evelyn_04307b8a04"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Open the Aperture all the way and it comes through. Close it all the way and the echo stops for ever — everything that's left of them goes silent, and we never hear any of it again."
