    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (BRIEFING, 1996)",
      "What you don't know is that some of it comes back. Not reflected — returned, through a layer of the deep crust we're calling the echo shelf. Delayed by years. Sometimes decades."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_15a66f6173"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (BRIEFING, 1996)",
